Dependencies
============

Symo is a symbolic computation library built on top of Decimo, an
arbitrary-precision integer and decimal library for Mojo.

Decimo (https://github.com/forfudan/decimo)
  Copyright 2025-2026 Yuhao Zhu
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Symo uses Decimo's arbitrary-precision numeric types (BigInt, BigDecimal)
as the concrete backend for exact numeric constants and evaluation.
